on the drawings.  The second paragraph is for non-standard applications for 
these control panels.  choose the desired paragraph and delete the other.</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<NPR>The guide specification describes control panels here in generic terms of master 
control panel and types of remote operating panels.</NPR><BRK/>
